  {
   "id": "trepang2-126212@major-2022-07-15",
   "gameId": "trepang2-126212",
   "displayName": "A Small Demo Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-07-15T16:14:07.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "THANK YOU FOR PLAYING OUR DEMO",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Sorry to yell, but our excitement for Trepang2 is as high as everyone else's.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "While we updated our demo after almost 3 years (Dec 2019, June 2022), we've also been hard at work for the full game, trying to ensure that what we show is as sick as we would want it to be. With the demo update, and more eyes on the rad project we're working on, we've been taking a lot of notes from everyone's feedback and input from the new demo. For now, we have a small update to the demo which should help with some players.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Safehouse Optimization",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed some disgusting FPS drops in the Safehouse. Oopsies 🥴",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Movement Key Binds & Controller Support",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "One big piece of feedback we heard was that we didn't have our movement keys rebindable, and we didn't natively have controller support. Now we do!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We have heard a lot of extremely helpful feedback from everybody, and we are still working on addressing a lot of them. For right now though, we hope some of you find these small fixes helpful.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Your support is immense and we are eternally grateful.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Discord: https://trepang2.com/discord",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "♥ - Trepang Studios",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
