  {
   "id": "trepang2-126212@major-2022-03-02",
   "gameId": "trepang2-126212",
   "displayName": "Progress Update - February 2022",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-03-02T00:40:19.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hello!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "This month has been very busy for us. We have been working on cutscenes, visual tweaks, and the boss battle for the 2nd mission. Also have been experimenting with player customization, cheats, and a new way to play the Horde gamemode.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We don't have anything we are ready to show from that just quite yet as it is still being worked on rigorously, but we can show this new gun and a preview of one of the side missions:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bolt Launcher",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A ridiculous explosive piercing/pinning weapon that can devastate and eviscerate.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you all for being so patient with us as we get ready for our release later this year. We could not feasibly do this without your support.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Youtube: https://www.youtube.com/c/TREPANG2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Discord: https://trepang2.com/discord",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "♥ - Trepang Studios",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
