  {
   "id": "trepang2-126212@major-2022-02-01",
   "gameId": "trepang2-126212",
   "displayName": "Progress Update - January 2022",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-02-01T22:53:33.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hello!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We have been making a ton of progress for Trepang2 in January.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "The Minigun",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "What started as a kitbash ended up being a reality. We've had the minigun available in much older demos for Trepang2, but now, it's finally here and is even more devastating than before. We plan to make the wind-up/down sounds more prevalent and intense as the enemies who wield them are a true threat.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Destructible Environments",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "As you can probably tell, Trepang2 is a game about a Subject who has no regard for order. We still gotta balance the particle effects being a bit too much. This video pokes fun at it too.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Interactables",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "To help the world not feel so static, we'll focus on a more interactable environment, such as computers, vending machines, and even this ridiculous Piano that could have a slew of easter eggs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Behind the scenes however, we have been working really hard on the prologue map, the intro cutscene, a new side mission, and a bunch of tweaks to the main menu. We may show some of the progress in the coming weeks.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for being patient, the game releases this year, and when we have a more precise date, we will let everyone know as soon as we know.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Discord: https://trepang2.com/discord",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "♥ - Trepang Studios",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
